{
  "_comment": [
    "Frozen inventory of every method the CLI exposes as `<namespace>.<method>`,",
    "split by whether it requires --confirm. Regenerate deliberately, never",
    "blindly: a diff here is a change to what an unattended agent may do",
    "without confirmation.",
    "",
    "Both lists are frozen, not just the writes. Freezing only the writes lets",
    "a newly added method sit in neither set and default to 'read' silently --",
    "which is exactly how research_comps and learn_location went ungated."
  ],
